.FR-p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Built as a self-aware war machine by the Malicron
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Corporation, Miho escaped when her creators tried
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]to reclaim her by force, critically damaged. She was
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]found and repaired by a young inventor, Braun,
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and has stayed by his side ever since, hoping to live
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]a normal, human life despite her origins.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Innocent, kind-hearted, and eager to learn
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]everything she can about the world, Miho
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]wants nothing more than to help — even
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]if her enormous strength and destructive
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]potential sometimes make that harder
.L 417.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]than it should be.
.CP
.SH
\&Miho: Attacks
.PP
\&Mode 1: Hand-to-Hand: Even barehanded, Miho is a competent combatant.
.PP
\&Mode 2: Gatling Gun: She's packin'! The more bullets, the better!
.PP
\&Mode 3: Missile Launcher: Speak softly and launch a big missile!
.PP
\&Mode 4: Sniper Rifle: Miho takes them out with robotic precision.
.PP
\&Mode SP: Miho Ray: Nothing will remain to hurt her.
.SH
\&Miho: Robot Characteristics
.PP
\&Miho draws energy from the sun, and without regular sunbaths switches to a weaker backup supply after a day. Her considerable density makes her hard to carry and can strain weak floors, and her robotic nature is hard to fully disguise.
.SH
\&Miho: Self-Preservation Mode
.PP
\&If her combined Health and Endurance drop to 10, Miho's consciousness shuts down and she single-mindedly eliminates any threat, friend or foe alike — returning to normal with no memory of what happened once the danger has passed.
